- **Pass 4** ($s=3$): Position $70 \equiv 1 \pmod{3}$ → survives. New position: $(70-1)/3 = 23$.
- **Pass 5** ($s=2$): Position $23 \equiv 2 \pmod{3}$ → survives. New position: $(23-2)/3 = 7$.
- **Pass 6** ($s=3$): Position $7 \equiv 1 \pmod{3}$ → survives. New position: $(7-1)/3 = 2$.
- **Pass 7** ($s=2$): Position $2 \equiv 2 \pmod{3}$ → receives code 1 → **is the sole survivor** ✓

